	(text "Hub 2 (cascaded on hub 1 P2) drives all four USB-A ports (two stacked SS-52100-004).\nEach port: CH217K current-limited switch (as dino_z80). Red LED = over-current on any port.\nPower budget: 4 ports x 0.5A = 2A on top of ~0.8A for the rest (CH217K limit ~0.6A per port, R = 100K).\nFull 4-port load: 12V / 2A adapter (9V needs ~1.7A, above the 1.5A hold of the DC input PTC F1).\nOn USB-C power the whole board is limited to 1.5A (F2 hold): light USB-A loads only (keyboard, mouse)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 168.91 31.75 0)
		(effects
